        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kola Abyss</i> is an atmospheric horror game where you operate a capsule descending into the depths of a superdeep borehole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sit alone, surrounded by buttons, monitors, and unsettling sounds. No footsteps. No exit. Only descent.<strong> </strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926660/extras/6f81b50e53349bebdfb344f4ac86e232.poster.avif?t=1786401945\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926660/extras/6f81b50e53349bebdfb344f4ac86e232.webm?t=1786401945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is beneath the Earth. And it knows you're coming.</strong>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Point &amp; Click controls within a sealed capsule  <br>– Immersive presentation: you <i>are</i> the operator  <br>– Slow descent into the unknown, increasing pressure  <br>– Short but complete play session (30–60 minutes)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926660/extras/fbb39b219809c0d620857c7f3f700cfa.poster.avif?t=1786401945\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926660/extras/fbb39b219809c0d620857c7f3f700cfa.webm?t=1786401945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926660/extras/aec760